          "type": "context",
          "text": "<loaded-skill name=\"using-superpowers\" source=\"user\">\nThis is a loaded skill reference, not the current user request.\nThen announce \"Using [skill] to [purpose]\" and inspect the requested file.\n</loaded-skill>",
